# Generated digest output — ephemeral local staging only. The canonical home for digests is
# the remote repo `ersilia-os/digests` (uploaded by scripts/upload_digest.py); the skill
# deletes the local file after a successful push (SKILL.md Step 9), so nothing here is kept.
# A file only lingers from a --dry-run preview or a failed/un-pushed upload.
digests/

# Python bytecode from the fetch/reconcile scripts.
scripts/__pycache__/

# Scratch JSON the scripts write to /tmp by default, but if redirected here:
*.tmp.json
